<title>UK: Kantonalbank sets 500 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kantonalbank sets 500 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Zurich Kantonalbank.</p>
<p>BORROWER PFANDBRIEFZENTRALE DER SCHWEIZERISCHEN KANTONALBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    28.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.2     PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-100     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  SWISS     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
